screenshot - a picture of the display

  screenshot                     the whole screen, into /home
  screenshot window              the window holding the keyboard
  screenshot window shot.png     somewhere of your choosing

Written as PNG, which keeps text sharp where JPEG would smear it. Named
for the moment it was taken when nobody names it, so two in a row do not
land on each other.

Super+S and Super+Shift+S do the same two things from the desktop.
